answers.approach:
Hush, gather real questions, then sample with care;
Across models and regions, see who appears there.
Track claims, links, tone, and the answers’ slow drift;
A mention without trust is no measurable gift.
Change one trusted source, then replay the same tune;
Watch downstream demand, but claim no cause too soon.
For prompts hide in shadows and models still grow;
We can test at the edges, not know what they know.
